00:36:04.610 --> 00:36:08.380
Hakkas ta laulma ja tantsima.

569
00:36:08.480 --> 00:36:11.470
Sina oled minu Rom.

570
00:36:11.570 --> 00:36:14.650
Mina olen sinu Romi.

571
00:36:14.750 --> 00:36:17.300
Mina olen sulle võlgu.

572
00:36:23.060 --> 00:36:25.460
Mina olen sulle.

573
00:37:33.200 --> 00:37:36.940
Ahah, otse, mis see nüüd oli?

